{
    "chapter_num": 5,
    "verses_count": 28,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Day of the Lord"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But concerning the times and the seasons, brethren, you have no need that I should write to you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For you yourselves know perfectly that the day of the Lord so comes as a thief in the night. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For when they say, “Peace and safety!” then sudden destruction comes upon them, as labor pains upon a pregnant woman. And they shall not escape. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But you, brethren, are not in darkness, so that this Day should overtake you as a thief. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You are all sons of light and sons of the day. We are not of the night nor of darkness. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore let us not sleep, as others "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "do,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " but let us watch and be "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "self-controlled"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sober. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For those who sleep, sleep at night, and those who get drunk are drunk at night. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But let us who are of the day be sober, putting on the breastplate of faith and love, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a helmet the hope of salvation. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For God did not appoint us to wrath, but to obtain salvation through our Lord Jesus Christ, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who died for us, that whether we wake or sleep, we should live together with Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or encourage"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "comfort each other and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "build one another up"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "edify one another, just as you also are doing."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Various Exhortations"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And we urge you, brethren, to recognize those who labor among you, and are over you in the Lord and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "instruct or warn"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "admonish you, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and to esteem them very highly in love for their work’s sake. Be at peace among yourselves."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now we "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "encourage"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "exhort you, brethren, warn those who are "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "insubordinate or idle"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "unruly, comfort the fainthearted, uphold the weak, be patient with all. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "See that no one renders evil for evil to anyone, but always pursue what is good both for yourselves and for all."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Rejoice always, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "pray without ceasing, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "in everything give thanks; for this is the will of God in Christ Jesus for you."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do not quench the Spirit. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do not despise prophecies. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Test all things; hold fast what is good. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Abstain from every form of evil."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Blessing and Admonition"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now may the God of peace Himself sanctify"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "set you apart"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you completely; and may your whole spirit, soul, and body be preserved blameless at the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He who calls you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " faithful, who also will do "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Brethren, pray for us."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Greet all the brethren with a holy kiss."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I charge you by the Lord that this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "letter"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "epistle be read to all the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits holy"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "holy brethren."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with you. Amen."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}